{"1829470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Melody's Escape 2","steam_appid":1829470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5007770],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and slide to the rhythm of <strong>your <i>own<\/i> music library<\/strong>!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melody is back, with <strong>vastly improved audio analysis algorithms<\/strong> that transcribe the energy  that you feel when listening to music into a synchronized gameplay experience, with a captivating and dynamic <strong>obstacle course<\/strong> synchronized to the <strong>beat of your music<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melody's movement speed will match the intensity and mood of your music, from walking during very calm parts up to all-out flying when your music explodes!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.poster.avif?t=1787127002\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.webm?t=1787127002\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.mp4?t=1787127002\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your own music library<\/strong>: works with any <strong>digital music file<\/strong> from your hard drive (.<strong>MP3<\/strong>, .<strong>FLAC<\/strong>, .<strong>OGG<\/strong>, .WAV, .M4A and many more DRM-free file formats are supported)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with almost <strong>all music genres and styles<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each action input is <strong>synchronized to the music<\/strong>. Jump on the beat and slide alongside held voices notes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize<\/strong> the look of Melody, with many character skins and haircuts. Includes <strong>Steam Workshop<\/strong> supports for community made cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stage environments that visually react to your music in their own unique style<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music analysis algorithms (human-made!), with <strong>vastly improved tempo, intensity and voice detection<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 14 licensed music tracks with hand-mapped levels (with various musical styles)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Warning<\/u>:<\/strong> the game is <strong>not compatible<\/strong> with music from <strong>online music streaming services<\/strong> (<i>as it is not a technical possibility<\/i>)<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/d67a1551c9e6ddddf5775e36fea5a8f1.poster.avif?t=1787127002\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/d67a1551c9e6ddddf5775e36fea5a8f1.webm?t=1787127002\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/d67a1551c9e6ddddf5775e36fea5a8f1.mp4?t=1787127002\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY LEVELS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus of Melody's Escape 2 is on <strong>immersing yourself<\/strong> in a flow state with your music and creating an elevated interactive experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 3 different difficulty levels to select your own playstyle:<br> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing<\/strong>: one-button only, for a relaxing casual experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium<\/strong>: using 4 different color buttons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense<\/strong>: using 8 buttons for inputs, for the full gameplay experience!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can even create your own Custom difficulty mode!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and slide to the rhythm of <strong>your <i>own<\/i> music library<\/strong>!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melody is back, with <strong>vastly improved audio analysis algorithms<\/strong> that transcribe the energy  that you feel when listening to music into a synchronized gameplay experience, with a captivating and dynamic <strong>obstacle course<\/strong> synchronized to the <strong>beat of your music<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melody's movement speed will match the intensity and mood of your music, from walking during very calm parts up to all-out flying when your music explodes!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.poster.avif?t=1787127002\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.webm?t=1787127002\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1829470\/extras\/1edb05d171c9376c260e24499d4e2771.mp4?t=1787127002